(text "I2C addresses: SHT40 0x44, TSL2591 0x29. Place U5 away from the charger and buck (self-heating).\nU6 needs a clear view of the light: no part taller than it nearby. U6 needs at least 2.7 V and is rated -30 to 70 C.\nNo copper under U5 other than its four pads (Sensirion land pattern); its centre pad stays unsoldered." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22d5742c-2aca-5bfb-8103-eb15e3cd424d"))
